    "sections": {
        "description": "Wedding Planning Services is designed for creating professional websites for wedding planners, event organizers, coordinators, and related service providers. It includes layouts for showcasing services, photo galleries, event portfolios, pricing packages, testimonials, and contact forms. The design focuses on clean layouts, readable typography, and organized content sections to present wedding events, vendors, and planning details clearly. This theme can be used by wedding planners, event management companies, decorators, photographers, venue planners, invitation designers, and bridal consultants who want to display their services and past events online. It supports responsive design, customizable sections, blog pages for wedding tips, and gallery layouts for event photos. Wedding Planning Services also includes homepage sections for featured services, client testimonials, image galleries, and contact information, making it suitable for service-based wedding businesses that need a simple and structured website to present their work and information online."
    },
